Subject: [PATCH 1973/3799] soh: rename D_8094C87E -> sUnusedIntroCsFlag2

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: set to 1 during the intro cutscene and never read
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Tw/z_boss_tw.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Tw/z_boss_tw.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Tw/z_boss_tw.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Tw/z_boss_tw.c
index 669f8df35..0deb95d40 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Tw/z_boss_tw.c
